{"title":"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/e/6be91d8532fe2a50e227f2fec7c3cecdd8758df3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> be an integer, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7bc3f8675e22632aac258135c9bb20236176e5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2,a_3,\\ldots ,a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"11\" /> be positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b823d421fa7a812fa4e0f734d3ba8d74fcf2a1d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2}a_{3}\\cdots a_{n}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77fb719e975225b59c64f1f3aa102c98a6c25f50.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1 + a_2)^2 (1 + a_3)^3 \\dotsm (1 + a_n)^n &gt; n^n.\\]\" width=\"286\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By AM-GM\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f72d2d93438be8a03d290199ef68809c1b298f67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+a_k)^k=(\\frac{1}{k-1}+\\frac{1}{k-1}+\\dots+\\frac{1}{k-1}+n_k)^k\\geq (k\\sqrt[k]{\\frac{a_k}{(k-1)^{k-1}}})^k=\\frac{k^k\\cdot a_k}{(k-1)^{k-1}}\\]\" width=\"609\" height=\"45\" />\nSubstituting back into our original equation we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd28781b3f890632e8c6442622fda5177b5df836.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+a_2)^2(1+a_3)^3\\dots(1+a_n)^n\\geq \\frac{2^2\\cdot a_2}{1^1}\\frac{3^3\\cdot a_3}{2^2}\\dots\\frac{n^n\\cdot a_n}{(n-1)^{n-1}}=\\frac{2^2}{1^2}\\frac{3^3}{2^2}\\frac{4^4}{3^3}\\dots\\frac{(n-1)^{n-1}}{(n-2)^{n-2}}\\frac{n^n}{(n-1)^{n-1}}\\cdot a_1a_2a_3\\dots a_n=n^n\\cdot 1=n^n\\]\" width=\"943\" height=\"44\" />\nhowever, we only proved its <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/025b160d1d2154d41bbd5a1be905402a240d5be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\geq n^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />, for the equality to happen, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f07050c2fd605426529d9859e58a014c34e92b5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k=\\frac{1}{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, which is impossible for all of them to be so, thus the equality is impossible\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO\">2012 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"